    path-keyed so the two are never interchangeable. Comparison table (reads eval_results.json)
    is untouched and is skipped entirely in latent-off mode.
  - Forces `gate_mode="disabled"` (the disable_gate mechanism — no weight edits).
  - Base models skipped in this mode (no latent channel; already evaluated gate-disabled).
